Maud Brackett Pattin,
clerk, Quartermaster Corps, War Department, Office of the Military Attaché,
American Embassy, Mexico City, Mexico, who, on July 28, 1934, will reach the
retirement age prescribed for automatic separation from the service, be exempted
from the provisions of this section and continued in the service until February 1,
1935;
